# No Browser Testing

Do not open, navigate, screenshot, click, or otherwise drive a browser (including Cursor browser tools, CDP, or a local URL) to verify changes.

The user tests the game themselves and will relay anything that needs to change. After making a change, stop and wait for their feedback.

This overrides any general instruction to verify web UI in a browser before finishing.
